{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "WeselyLandUse",
    "description": "Wesely (1989) land-use area fractions for CONUS at 0.05°, from MODIS MCD12C1 v6.1 (2016): the 11 class fractions f_<class> that DryDepositionGas weights its mosaic deposition velocity by. Data source + loader model; the host regrids it onto its grid.",
    "authors": ["AtmosphericDeposition.jl / DepositionMTK.jl contributors", "EarthSciModels"],
    "created": "2026-10-28T00:00:00Z",
    "tags": ["atmospheric_deposition", "land-use", "wesley-1989", "modis", "static", "conus", "longlat"],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Friedl, M., Sulla-Menashe, D. (2022). MODIS/Terra+Aqua Land Cover Type Yearly L3 Global 0.05Deg CMG V061 (MCD12C1). NASA EOSDIS Land Processes DAAC. doi:10.5067/MODIS/MCD12C1.061"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Wesely, M. L. (1989). Atmospheric Environment 23(6), 1293-1304 (the 11 land-use classes)."
      },
      {
        "citation": "Source: jialinl6/DepositionMTK.jl@cbe7d7db (branch superfast-gas-only), src/landuse_fractions.jl, data/landuse_wesely_conus_0p05.nc (built by data/preprocess_landuse.jl)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "WESELY_LANDUSE_CONUS": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jialinl6/DepositionMTK.jl/cbe7d7db0a86bd6945f6b06d1fdc8274399b33de/data/landuse_wesely_conus_0p05.nc"
      },
      "reference": {
        "citation": "MODIS MCD12C1 v6.1 2016 Land_Cover_Type_1_Percent, IGBP bands summed into the Wesely (1989) classes (many-to-one, covering all 17) and windowed to CONUS.",
        "url": "https://github.com/jialinl6/DepositionMTK.jl/tree/superfast-gas-only/data"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": ["land-use", "static", "conus", "categorical-fractions", "longlat"],
        "file_format": "netCDF-4; variable percent (ubyte, 0..100), dims (class, lat, lon) = (11, 700, 1400)",
        "native_resolution_deg": {"lon": 0.05, "lat": 0.05},
        "native_extent_edges_deg": {"lon": [-130.0, -60.0], "lat": [20.0, 55.0]},
        "coordinates": "lon/lat are Float32 cell centres; exact edges are window_*_min + k*cell_size.",
        "classes": [
          "urban",
          "agricultural",
          "range",
          "deciduous",
          "coniferous",
          "mixedforest",
          "water",
          "barren",
          "wetland",
          "rangeag",
          "rockyshrubs"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "models": {
    "WeselyLandUse": {
      "reference": {
        "notes": "source_ref: jialinl6/DepositionMTK.jl@cbe7d7db (branch superfast-gas-only):src/landuse_fractions.jl and data/landuse_wesely_conus_0p05.nc.\n\nUpstream reads this file at run time, conservatively area-averages it onto the simulation grid (_remap_landuse: weights dlon*(sin(lat_hi) - sin(lat_lo)) per overlap, cell edges rebuilt from the window_* / cell_size attributes because the Float32 lon/lat centres sit ~1e-6° off the 0.05° multiples), refuses a grid that reaches outside the window, and its GEOS-FP coupling binds DryDepositionGas.f_<class> to the result at each cell. Here the file is a data source and the 11 fractions are data-fed parameters; the conservative remap onto a host grid and the f_<class> -> DryDepositionGas.f_<class> edges belong to the host's coupling (esm-spec §8.6), like every other source in this repo. Every native cell sums to exactly 100%, so the fractions sum to 1.\n\nThe URL is pinned to the reference commit in the jialinl6/DepositionMTK.jl fork; point it elsewhere if the file moves (it is the same 1,317,215-byte file either way).\n\nNo inline tests: a data-fed model's values come from the fetched file. The class axis was checked against the file directly: its class_name variable lists the 11 classes in this order, every cell sums to 100, and the dominant class is urban over Los Angeles, agricultural over Iowa (96%) and water over the Gulf of Mexico, the same checks as upstream's test/fractional_test.jl."
      },
      "variables": {
        "lon": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "rad",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Longitude of the model grid point (radians). Set by the host, as for the other loaders."
        },
        "lat": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "rad",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Latitude of the model grid point (radians). Set by the host, as for the other loaders."
        },
        "f_urban": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [],
          "description": "Area fraction of Wesely (1989) land-use class 1 (urban), the native 0.05° cell's percentage / 100. Same name as the DryDepositionGas parameter it is meant to drive.",
          "update": {
            "kind": "data",
            "source": "WESELY_LANDUSE_CONUS",
            "from": {
              "file_variable": "percent",
              "select": {"axes": [{"fixed": 0}, "all", "all"]},
              "unit_conversion": 0.01,
              "description": "percent(class = 1, lat, lon): class 1 (urban) slice of the UInt8 percentage cube; the native dims are (class, lat, lon) and `fixed` is 0-based."
            }
          }
        },
        "f_agricultural": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [],
